# Beam me up {3}{G} (Adversary by Algorithm): cast hard on turn 1 for {2}{G} (three Moxen) with Llanowar Elves already
# out (paid with the Forest), it makes a 3/3 colorless Illusion artifact creature token. On turn 3 it is cast from the
# graveyard for {3}{G}: four mana pay it exactly (the pool is empty right after paying). Bot2's Llanowar Elves cannot be
# the creature returned (it must be one Bot1 controls); Bot1's own Elves can. The spell is exiled as it leaves the stack,
# as a flashback or harmonize spell is (CR 702.34a, 702.180a), and the Illusion tokens stay: two of them, the first from
# the hard cast.

